<p>Nope. Everything here was made with the intent of making it an SCP.</p>
<p>That said, my intention was to do something a bit different with your typical alternate universe scip, specifically in making a nice, logically constructed world to go with it, without dropping a ton of exposition as to what is going on (a la 093)</p>
